  "job_B8.4.3.2_20251003_114848": {
    "chunk_text": "we nane hlafas. \u00dea se h\u00e6lend \u00fe\u00e6t wiste he cw\u00e6\u00f0, hw\u00e6t \u00feence ge for\u00feam ge hlafas nabba\u00f0; Gyt ge ne oncnawa\u00f0 ne ne Eagan ge habba\u00f0 & ne geseo\u00f0, & earan & ne gehyra\u00f0; Ne ge ne \u00feenca\u00fe. Hw\u00e6nne ic br\u00e6c fif hlafas & twegen fixas & hu fela wyligena ge namon fulle; Hi cw\u00e6don, \u00fea twelfe. And hw\u00e6nne seofon hlafas feower \u00feusendum & hu fela wyligena brytsyna ge namon; Hi s\u00e6don, \u00d0a s\u00e6de he him, hwi ne ongyte ge gyt? And hi comon \u00fea to Bedzaida, & hi brohton him \u00fea \u00e6nne blindne, & hine b\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t he hine \u00e6thrine. & \u00fea \u00e6thran he \u00fe\u00e6s blindan hand, & l\u00e6dde hine butan \u00fea wic; & sp\u00e6tte on his eagan, & his hand \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 he \u00fea \u00f0a he hine beseah; Ic geseo men swylce treow gangende. Eft he asette his handa ofer his eagan & he geseah \u00fea, & wear\u00f0 geedniwod, swa \u00fe\u00e6t he beorhtlice eall \u00d0a sende he hine to his huse & cw\u00e6\u00f0, ga to \u00feinum huse, & \u00f0eah \u00feu on tun ga n\u00e6negum \u00feu hit ne \u00d0a eode he & his leorningcnihtas on \u00fe\u00e6t castel Cesare\u00e6 Philippi; & he on wege his leorningcnihtas \u00dea andswarodon hi, sume Iohannem \u00feone Fulluhtere, sume Heliam, sume sumne of \u00feam witegum. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, hw\u00e6t secge ge \u00fe\u00e6t ic sy; \u00fea andswarude Petrus him & c",
